Canonical page  https://www.suburbcost.com.au/dataset/
Data file       https://www.suburbcost.com.au/dataset/suburbcost-council-running-costs.csv
Rates file      https://www.suburbcost.com.au/dataset/suburbcost-council-rates.csv
Dictionary      https://www.suburbcost.com.au/dataset/data-dictionary.md

Read the data dictionary before computing across states. In the data file the
council rate column holds four different statistics, and in the rates file it
holds three, one per state. Averaging across them produces a number that means
nothing.

This is a council-level aggregate. Suburb-level data is not published.
SuburbCost publishes no property prices, land valuations or capital growth.
